flowchart TD
    A["Brand gives us ONE thing:\ntheir website link"] --> B["1. Read the website\n(figure out what kind of business it is)"]
    B --> C["2. Auto-write a few\nbuyer questions"]
    C --> D["3. Ask 2 AI chatbots\nthose questions"]
    D --> E{"4. Does the brand\nget mentioned?"}
    E -->|No| F["5. Explain why\n(plain words)"]
    F --> G["6. Auto-write a clean\ninfo file about the brand"]
    G --> H["7. Quick human check\n(one click: looks good?)"]
    H --> I["8. Small tool serves this\nfile to AI agents"]
    I --> J["9. Ask the SAME question\nagain, live"]
    J --> K["Judges see the AI's answer\nchange in front of them"]
    E -->|Yes| L["Brand already visible -\nshow the good score instead"]

    style A fill:#e8f4fd
    style K fill:#d4f7d4
    style L fill:#d4f7d4
